ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_HelpScaryPokemon::
    .string "LOSTELLE: Whimper… Sniff…\n"
    .string "Oh! Please, help!\p"
    .string "A scary POKéMON appeared there\n"
    .string "a little while ago.\p"
    .string "It kept scaring.\n"
    .string "It made LOSTELLE scared.\p"
    .string "I'm too scared to move!\n"
    .string "But I want to go home…$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_HereItComesAgain::
    .string "Oh! Here it comes again!\n"
    .string "No! Go away! It's scaring me!\p"
    .string "Waaaaaaah!\n"
    .string "I want my daddy!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_ThankYouHaveThis::
    .string "Ohh! That was so scary!\n"
    .string "Thank you!\p"
    .string "LOSTELLE came to pick some\n"
    .string "BERRIES.\p"
    .string "You can have this!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_LetsGoHome::
    .string "What's your name?\p"
    .string "LOSTELLE's scared, so can I go\n"
    .string "with you to my daddy's house?\p"
    .string "Okay!\n"
    .string "Let's go home!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_BerryPouchIsFull::
    .string "Your BERRY POUCH is full.\n"
    .string "I guess you don't want this.$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_WelcomeToBerryForest::
    .string "Welcome to the BERRY FOREST\p"
    .string "Be friendly and share BERRIES with\n"
    .string "others and POKéMON.$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_BewareWildBerryLovingMons::
    .string "Beware of wild, BERRY-loving\n"
    .string "POKéMON!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_ShrineAwaitsPower::
    .string "An ancient shrine stands before you,\n"
    .string "covered in mysterious symbols.\p"
    .string "Strange energy seems to swirl around\n"
    .string "it, but it remains dormant…\p"
    .string "Perhaps only one who has proven\n"
    .string "themselves as a true CHAMPION\l"
    .string "could awaken its power.$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_ShrineGlowsMysteriously::
    .string "The ancient shrine begins to glow\n"
    .string "with an otherworldly light…\p"
    .string "Time itself seems to bend and\n"
    .string "shimmer around the sacred stone…\p"
    .string "The very air hums with temporal\n"
    .string "energy, as if responding to your\l"
    .string "presence as a CHAMPION!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_ForestGuardianEmerges::
    .string "A rift in time opens above the shrine!\p"
    .string "From across the ages, the legendary\n"
    .string "guardian of forests materializes!\p"
    .string "CELEBI, the time-traveling POKéMON,\n"
    .string "has appeared to test your worth!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_CelebiCry::
    .string "Bi-bi!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_CelebiVanishesThroughTime::
    .string "CELEBI lets out a gentle cry before\n"
    .string "fading back through the streams of time…\p"
    .string "The shrine's glow slowly dims, but\n"
    .string "you sense you've been blessed by\l"
    .string "the forest's ancient guardian.$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_CelebiJoinsYou::
    .string "CELEBI gazes at you with ancient\n"
    .string "wisdom, recognizing your pure heart.\p"
    .string "The time-traveling guardian has\n"
    .string "chosen to accompany you on your\l"
    .string "journey through space and time!$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_CelebiDisappears::
    .string "CELEBI chirps softly and disappears\n"
    .string "into the timestream…\p"
    .string "Perhaps it will return when you're\n"
    .string "ready to face it again.$"

ThreeIsland_BerryForest_Text_ShrineQuietNow::
    .string "The ancient shrine sits quietly now,\n"
    .string "its temporal energy spent.\p"
    .string "The memory of your encounter with\n"
    .string "the time-traveling guardian lingers\l"
    .string "in the peaceful forest air.$"

